Note that your armour will still get rusty.

Also note that when you are not wearing a piece of armour, the rust
monster cannot touch it. The same goes for armour that is worn but
covered by other armour (for example, a worn cloak will not rust and
protect ring mail below it).

My tactic is usually to try to take off my rustprone armour before the R
reaches me (this may be a problem), and unwield iron weapons. You can
just beat the R to death with your bare hands, if you don't have any
non-rustprone weapons.

