> rocks, you name it.  The rust monster will eat iron
> objects so rocks work best.  Retreat, throw rock, retreat,
> throw rock.

Throwing something the rust monster will eat will slow it down, though.

> Rust monsters are slow enough that you can
> do that until you run out of throwables.

